  "notes": "The --refresh-models flag was already wired by the original worker (doctor.ts line 797+). The only remaining failure was a single test: `formatConnectorHealthLines > shows [PASS] with API key label for non-Claude provider`. The test creates a HealthCheckResult without authMethod; the code fell to 'auth configured' instead of 'API key configured'. Fix: added `|| am === undefined` to the api_key branch in formatConnectorHealthLines (doctor.ts line 312) so that non-Claude providers default to 'API key configured' when authMethod is absent. All 190 doctor tests now pass. The 9 failures in the broader suite (doctor-checks.test.ts, docker e2e, provider-smoke, mcp help) are pre-existing and outside this task's scope (confirmed by running on baseline before my change).",
